Prices from firecrawl.dev/pricing (the page defaults to annual billing):

```json
{
  "source": "https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing",
  "plans": {
    "Hobby":    { "billed_annually_per_month": 16,  "billed_monthly_per_month": 19,  "credits_per_month": 5000 },
    "Standard": { "billed_annually_per_month": 83,  "billed_monthly_per_month": 100, "credits_per_month": 100000 },
    "Growth":   { "billed_annually_per_month": 333, "billed_monthly_per_month": 400, "credits_per_month": 500000 }
  },
  "currency": "USD"
}
```

The page states the annual-billing rates and the Hobby monthly rate ($19) directly. I worked out the monthly-billing prices for Standard and Growth from the "Save $X" figures on the page, so treat them as approximate: Standard is $83 plus $198/12, about $100, and Growth is $333 plus $798/12, about $400.

